{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
REVYTECH Wayfire has been installed.

Quick start (VT console recommended):
  1. Enable seatd:  sysrc seatd_enable=YES && service seatd start
  2. Add your user to the "video" group if needed
  3. Install the shell/panel:  pkg install revytech-wf-shell
     (or the meta port revytech-wayfire-desktop)
  4. Launch with a session script that sets XDG_RUNTIME_DIR and
     LIBSEAT_BACKEND=seatd (see examples under share/examples/wayfire)

Configuration:
  ~/.config/wayfire.ini
  ~/.config/wf-shell.ini and ~/.config/wf-shell/config.json

This package conflicts with stock FreeBSD wayfire — do not install both.
EOM
}
